# Public-API reference example — ships in docs, not in the package
force-app/main/default/classes/DocGenDataProviderExample.cls
force-app/main/default/classes/DocGenDataProviderExample.cls-meta.xml

# NOTE: DocGenEinsteinProvider and the DocGen_HTML_Body prompt template used to
# be fenced off here. They now live in agentforce-ext/, their own 2GP package
# directory, because neither can ship in the BASE package:
#   - a package containing ConnectApi.EinsteinLLM builds, but is REFUSED at
#     install in an org without Einstein ("Type is not visible")
#   - a package containing a GenAiPromptTemplate makes the WHOLE package require
#     the Generative AI Prompt Templates feature, gating install for everyone
# Both measured 2026-07-26. Keep them out of force-app.
